  "description": "Attractive studio apartment are now available in a prime central Dublin location, situated beside Portobello Bridge. Conveniently located within a few minutes’ walk of St Stephen’s Green, Trinity College and the Charlemont Luas stop, the apartments offer excellent access to Dublin city centre and convenient transport links.\nThe apartment has been refurbished and tastefully finished throughout, while retaining their charming original period features, including an ornate entrance, decorative coving, high ceilings and traditional mantels.\nThe location is exceptionally convenient, with a wide selection of shops, restaurants, cafés, gourmet food stores and local amenities all within easy walking distance. The Swan Leisure Centre, Omniplex Cinema and Swan Shopping Centre are also nearby, providing excellent leisure and shopping facilities.\nThe monthly rent includes timed communal heating during the winter months and domestic waste disposal.\nApplications by email only. Please provide full details of all applicants when submitting an application.",
